					"content": "关于[蒲公英]…$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207420102
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 207420102,
					"content": "啊！蒲公英！全都飞走了！$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207420103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙萝拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 207420103,
					"content": "你做什么啊！这盆蒲公英好不容易才长好的！$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207420104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙萝拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 207420104,
					"content": "我在帮它播撒到远方…$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207420105
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 207420105,
					"content": "这是在城里！飞不了多远就会被墙挡住的！$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207420106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙萝拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 207420106,
					"content": "这样就可以长出更多蒲公英了…$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207420107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 207420107,
					"content": "那你直接拿着蒲公英籽，去城外放飞不就好了吗？！$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207420108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙萝拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 207420108,
					"content": "呜…我的蒲公英，好不容易才种好的…$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207420109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙萝拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 207420109,
					"content": "你…你，再需要蒲公英，直接去城外采不就好了？$UNRELEASED",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						207420110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "芙萝拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 207420110,
					"content": "而且…这盆蒲公英的花籽还是你帮我搜集的，我照顾了它好久才让它长大…你就这么对它吗？$UNRELEASED",
